{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CXbcKAEqAkXja4YHYQmrVr","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→// Canonical example of `match`. Exercises both nullary and payload\n     2→// patterns plus a wildcard.\n     3→\n     4→enum Shape {\n     5→    Circle(radius: int)\n     6→    Square(side: int)\n     7→    Unknown\n     8→}\n     9→\n    10→fn area(s: Shape) -> int {\n    11→    match s {\n    12→        .Circle(r) -> r * r * 3\n    13→        .Square(side) -> side * side\n    14→        .Unknown -> 0\n    15→    }\n    16→}\n    17→\n    18→fn main() {\n    19→    println(string(area(Shape.Circle(5))))\n    20→    println(string(area(Shape.Square(4))))\n    21→    println(string(area(Shape.Unknown)))\n    22→}\n    23→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RGkfPQEKR22Wd4E5Q2H9dn","session_id":"99531a4f-114c-49ff-a929-dced21bdd83f","uuid":"b4ba48de-c699-4b0a-8733-ad6fa5198a7f","timestamp":"2026-04-09T09:48:30.222Z"}
